hello and welcome back to my channel my  name is samuel leeds and i'm a property  investor and in this video you're going  to be learning the three ways to make  money from property if you enjoy my  channel please do add me a massive favor  and subscribe to the youtube channel  turn the notification bell on and also  don't forget to smash that like button  so how do you make money from property  when you're an a property investor well  the first thing is to acknowledge that  when you're buying a property  the sole purpose of a property  investment is to make  money when a lot of people buy  properties they mix their emotions and  their feelings into the purchase  if you're a home buyer and you're buying  a house to live in you're going to look  at all the different factors of what's  the garden like what's the color of the  house do i like the feel of it what's  the neighbors like where are the nearest  schools would my children like these  schools and there's hundreds and  hundreds of different factors into your  purchase decision  however when you're buying a property as  an investment you need to be saying does  it tick the three boxes and every single  box boils down to the money now some  people might be thinking samuel  it's not all about the money however it  is all about the money because when  you're buying a property as an  investment you have to make a financial  decision and you have to purchase with  your formulas not with your feelings not  with your emotions so what are the three  ways that a property investment makes  you money it's very very very simple the  first way that property makes money is  when you buy a property over time it is  likely to appreciate in value over time  now the reason the property goes up in  value over time is because there's  limited supply in the in  the country there's only so much land  available in any given country and when  there's a limited amount of something it  holds its value especially when it's a  necessity and houses and land is a  necessity we have an overpopulation of  people on the planet and we have a  shortage of houses and a shortage of  land on average property prices double  in value every 10 years so when you buy  a property you need to look at the  capital appreciation of that property  now some people have argued with me on  this and have said samuel property  property prices do not double in value  every 10 years they've said this is  completely untrue however  i would urge you to do your own research  and look at the last 10 and the 10  before that and the 10 before that and  the 10 before that and the 10 before  that and you will see the pattern is  that properties really do  double in value on average every 10  years  now many people say  hmm maybe they did in the past but i  don't think that's going to happen over  the next 10. well guess what that's  exactly what people were saying 10 years  ago i bought my first property  investment in birmingham in 2009  just after the crash and everybody was  telling me that it was not going to  double over the next 10 years that was  then this is now guess what's happened  it doubled within 10 years it's now  worth 200 000 pounds so that is the  first way that you are going to make  money from investing in property now  this is something that is you could  argue is a little bit out of your  control  it may happen over time it may not you  can't rely on capital appreciation to  pay your bills which is why there's two  other ways that property makes money by  the way if you're enjoying the video so  far please don't forget to hit the like  button that would really really help me  out the second way that you make money  in property is of course  via the rent  now when you buy a property you're going  to try and make sure that you get as  much rent as possible  how are you going to do this are you  going to do this by forcing the rents up  and being a really greedy landlord and  charging a really high rent and and  screwing over your tenants of course not  you're going to do this by buying a  property in an area that is popular that  has a high demand that tenants are  wanting to rent so instead of when  looking at houses thinking about how you  feel about the house instead you should  ask how will tenants feel about the  house what are letting agencies local to  the area saying the rent will be and you  need to make sure that your rent is  going to cover all of the expenses of  owning the house namely the mortgage  payments the management the maintenance  void periods and you're going to need to  make sure that you're left with a nice  profit on that property every single  month that is what you call your passive  income  your passive income is going to make you  financially free and the capital  appreciation of the house is what's  going to make you rich and that's how  many people have become  accidental millionaires  however there is still a third way to  make money when buying property and the  third way is by buying a property below  market value if there's a house that's  worth a hundred thousand pounds and you  buy it for eighty thousand pounds  you have just made  twenty thousand pounds in equity  you have just added twenty thousand  pounds to your net worth and the great  thing about property is it's not like  bitcoin or gold or silver where the  price is fixed you can find motivated  sellers that are in a rush to sell and  you can buy it below market value and  add to your net worth and make money  from the discount of the property now  again is this ethical is it ethical to  find people that are in a really bad  situation maybe they're in dire straits  and they need to sell their house  quickly is it ethical for you to come  along and to agree to buy at a cheap  price  well in business you always need a  willing buyer and a willing seller so if  someone's in a rush to sell their  property because they're about to go  repossessed or maybe they're about to  move abroad and they need the money to  buy their second home they've got a job  career change or whatever it may be you  need to remember you're actually helping  that person move on in their life and  because you're helping them move on  quickly and promptly in their life  your reward is you're getting a discount  this is win win  everything in business has to be win win  a willing buyer and a willing seller and  that is how most businesses in fact  pretty much all businesses make money  and become successful so those are the  three ways that you can make money in  property by  waiting for the property to go up in  value someone once said don't wait to  buy land buy land and wait  the second way is by renting the  property out and receiving a passive  income from the rental of that property  and the third way is by buying at a  discount below market value and adding  to your net worth from the discount of  the property i hope you enjoyed this  video if you want to see more videos  like this then don't forget to subscribe  to the channel i also i show you around  one of my students house in a video and  i can show you how one of my students  made 400 thousand pounds profit on one  property deal very very quickly as well  within a matter of months i really think  you'd enjoy that video if you want to  watch it you can check it out right over  here and of course don't forget to  subscribe to the channel hit the like  button and i will see you over on the  next video
 

